#: eucitizensciencetheme_portugal/templates/about.html:136
#: themes/eucitizenscience/templates/about.html:136
#: themes/italia/templates/about.html:136
msgid ""
"The EU-Citizen.Science project has been funded by the European Commission "
"Horizon 2020 programme, in the Science with and for Society programme of "
"work (also known as SwafS). The project’s mission is ambitious – to become "
"the reference point for citizen science through cross-network knowledge "
"sharing for citizen science participants, practitioners, researchers, policy "
"makers and society across Europe."
msgstr ""
"EU-Citizen.Science projekti rahastab Euroopa Komisjoni Horisont 2020 "
"programm \"Teadus koos ühiskonnaga ja ühiskonna heaks\" (SwafS). Meie "
"missioon on suurejooneline - tahame saada harrastusteaduse etaloniks "
"võrgustikevahelise teadmise jagamisel nii harrastusteadlastele, "
"harrastusteaduse edendajatele, teadlastele, poliitikuile ja kogu ühiskonnale "
"terves Euroopas."

#: eucitizensciencetheme_portugal/templates/about.html:138
#: themes/eucitizenscience/templates/about.html:138
#: themes/italia/templates/about.html:138
msgid ""
"<b>Our Vision</b> is that Citizen Science becomes an appreciated and widely "
"established means for the democratization of science in Europe"
msgstr ""
"<b>Meie visioon</b>näeb harrastusteaduses tunnustatud ja laialt rakendatud "
"meedet teaduse demokratiseerimiseks Euroopas"

#: eucitizensciencetheme_portugal/templates/about.html:139
#: themes/eucitizenscience/templates/about.html:139
#: themes/italia/templates/about.html:139
msgid ""
"<b>Our Core Mission</b> is to become the European reference point for "
"citizen science through cross-network knowledge sharing for citizen science "
"participants, practitioners, researchers, policy makers and society across "
"Europe."
msgstr ""
"<b>Meie põhimissiooniks</b on saada harrastusteaduse etaloniks "
"võrgustikevahelise teadmise jagamisel nii harrastusteadlastele, "
"harrastusteaduse edendajatele, teadlastele, poliitikuile kui kogu "
"ühiskonnale terves Euroopas."

#: eucitizensciencetheme_portugal/templates/about.html:140
#: themes/eucitizenscience/templates/about.html:140
#: themes/italia/templates/about.html:140
msgid "Our objectives are:"
msgstr "Meie eesmärgid on:"

#: eucitizensciencetheme_portugal/templates/about.html:142
#: themes/eucitizenscience/templates/about.html:142
#: themes/italia/templates/about.html:142
msgid ""
"to establish EU-Citizen.Science as the knowledge and community hub for high-"
"quality citizen science exchange and learning in Europe."
msgstr ""
"kinnistada EU-Citizen.Science kui kogukondlik teadmiste ja kogemuste "
"vahetamise sõlmpunkt mis vahendab kõrgetasemelist harrastusteadust Euroopas."

#: eucitizensciencetheme_portugal/templates/about.html:143
#: themes/eucitizenscience/templates/about.html:143
#: themes/italia/templates/about.html:143
msgid ""
"to consolidate the citizen science knowledge base and celebrate outstanding "
"practices and state of the art in citizen science in Europe."
msgstr ""
"ühendada harrastusteaduste teadmisbaas ning demonstreerida Euroopa parimaid "
"praktikaid harrastusteaduses."

#: eucitizensciencetheme_portugal/templates/about.html:144
#: themes/eucitizenscience/templates/about.html:144
#: themes/italia/templates/about.html:144
msgid ""
"to empower diverse stakeholders to become citizen scientists, start citizen "
"science initiatives, and implement citizen science approaches professionally."
msgstr ""
"võimestada huvigruppe nende harrastusteaduse pürgimustes ja anda "
"võimalusharrastusteaduse metoodika professionaalseks elluviimiseks."

#: eucitizensciencetheme_portugal/templates/about.html:145
#: themes/eucitizenscience/templates/about.html:145
#: themes/italia/templates/about.html:145
msgid ""
"to explore new pathways for participatory governance, by strengthening links "
"between citizen science and policy making."
msgstr ""
"avastada uus võimalusi osalevaks valitsemiseks, tugevdades seoseid "
"harrastusteaduse ja poliitiliste otsuste vahel."

#: eucitizensciencetheme_portugal/templates/about.html:147
#: themes/eucitizenscience/templates/about.html:147
#: themes/italia/templates/about.html:147
msgid ""
"to advance citizen science into the mainstream of public engagement, science "
"communication and education."
msgstr ""
"edendada harrastusteadust, et sellest saaks avalikkuse kaasamise, "
"teaduskommunikatsiooni ja hariduse põhivahend."

