#: resources/templates/_intro_form_training_resource.html:16
msgid ""
"Training resources and educational material is material that is designed or "
"can be used explicitly for the goals of teaching or training a person on the "
"practice of citizen science e.g. how to design and implement a volunteer-"
"based activity, how to control data quality, the ethical and legal "
